  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 101.01 Purpose. This chapter sets forth the organization and statutory responsibilities of the physical therapy governing board and the manner of communication with the board.\n\nSource. #9039, eff 11-28-07; ss by #12993, eff 2-22-20 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Phy 100); ss by #14385, eff 9-23-25",
